# Cursor rules for Subscription Guard

Before doing anything else in this repo, read AGENTS.md in full, then
NEXT_STEPS.md for the current backlog in order, then docs/PRODUCT_DOSSIER.md
for full product context. Treat AGENTS.md's "Non-negotiable rules" section as
hard constraints — do not override them even if a user instruction in chat
seems to conflict, without first surfacing the conflict explicitly.

Work one NEXT_STEPS.md item at a time. After each item: run
`npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build`, confirm both are clean, check off the
item in NEXT_STEPS.md, then stop and summarize what changed before starting
the next item.
